  "description": "Cross-platform byte provider for gigabyte-scale binary files — zero WPF dependency.\n\n      Provides high-performance services for reading, writing, and editing binary data:\n      • ByteProvider — ultra-fast file I/O with virtual/physical position mapping\n      • EditsManager — in-memory edit tracking (modify, insert, delete)\n      • UndoRedoManager — full undo/redo support\n      • SearchEngine — pattern search (text, hex, wildcard, relative, regex)\n      • ChangesetSnapshot — immutable snapshot of pending edits for serialization\n\n      Targets .NET 8.0+ (no Windows-specific APIs).\n      Usable in WPF, WinForms, console, ASP.NET and cross-platform applications.",
